   "script": "MossdeepCity_EventScript_Man",
   "texts": {
    "MossdeepCity_Text_SurfExhilarating": "A voyage on a ship is fine.\\pBut crossing the sea with POKéMON\\nusing SURF...\\pNow that's an exhilarating trip!\\nWouldn't you agree, youngster?$"
